{
  "book": "3nephi",
  "bookName": "3 Nephi",
  "chapter": 24,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 230.401,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 10.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he commanded them that they should write the words which the Father had given unto Malachi, which he should tell unto them.",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 10.397,
      "end": 14.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after they were written he expounded them.",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 14.71,
      "end": 18.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these are the words which he did tell unto them, saying:",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 18.187,
      "end": 20.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus said the Father unto Malachi",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 20.596,
      "end": 22.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "\u2014Behold, I will send my messenger,",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 22.959,
      "end": 25.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall prepare the way before me,",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 25.322,
      "end": 32.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord whom ye seek shall suddenly come to his temple, even the messenger of the covenant, whom ye delight in;",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 32.282,
      "end": 33.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, he shall come,",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.948,
      "end": 35.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "24:1",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 36.393,
      "end": 39.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But who may abide the day of his coming,",
      "verse": "24:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 39.267,
      "end": 41.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who shall stand when he appeareth?",
      "verse": "24:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 41.583,
      "end": 45.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he is like a refiner's fire, and like fuller's soap.",
      "verse": "24:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 45.792,
      "end": 49.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall sit as a refiner and purifier of silver;",
      "verse": "24:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 49.641,
      "end": 59.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall purify the sons of Levi, and purge them as gold and silver, that they may offer unto the Lord an offering in righteousness.",
      "verse": "24:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 59.748,
      "end": 67.643,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then shall the offering of Judah and Jerusalem be pleasant unto the Lord, as in the days of old, and as in former years.",
      "verse": "24:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 68.323,
      "end": 85.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will come near to you to judgment; and I will be a swift witness against the sorcerers, and against the adulterers, and against false swearers, and against those that oppress the hireling in his wages, the widow and the fatherless,",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 85.639,
      "end": 89.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that turn aside the stranger, and fear not me,",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 89.302,
      "end": 91.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "24:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 91.747,
      "end": 93.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I am the Lord,",
      "verse": "24:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 93.367,
      "end": 94.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I change not;",
      "verse": "24:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 95.033,
      "end": 98.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore ye sons of Jacob are not consumed.",
      "verse": "24:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 98.778,
      "end": 103.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Even from the days of your fathers ye are gone away from mine ordinances,",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 103.834,
      "end": 105.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have not kept them.",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 105.454,
      "end": 106.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Return unto me",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 106.934,
      "end": 108.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will return unto you,",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 108.972,
      "end": 110.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 110.917,
      "end": 112.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But ye say:",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 112.397,
      "end": 114.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherein shall we return?",
      "verse": "24:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 114.749,
      "end": 116.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Will a man rob God?",
      "verse": "24:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 116.508,
      "end": 117.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yet ye have robbed me.",
      "verse": "24:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 118.174,
      "end": 119.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But ye say:",
      "verse": "24:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 119.654,
      "end": 121.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherein have we robbed thee?",
      "verse": "24:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 121.413,
      "end": 123.038,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In tithes and offerings.",
      "verse": "24:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 123.718,
      "end": 125.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye are cursed with a curse,",
      "verse": "24:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 125.756,
      "end": 128.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye have robbed me, even this whole nation.",
      "verse": "24:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 129.594,
      "end": 132.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Bring ye all the tithes into the storehouse,",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 132.468,
      "end": 134.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there may be meat in my house;",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 135.063,
      "end": 136.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prove me now herewith,",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 137.008,
      "end": 138.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 138.813,
      "end": 141.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if I will not open you the windows of heaven,",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 141.779,
      "end": 146.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and pour you out a blessing that there shall not be room enough to receive it.",
      "verse": "24:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 147.103,
      "end": 150.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will rebuke the devourer for your sakes,",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 150.209,
      "end": 153.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he shall not destroy the fruits of your ground;",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 153.593,
      "end": 157.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall your vine cast her fruit before the time in the fields,",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 157.906,
      "end": 159.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "24:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 160.351,
      "end": 163.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all nations shall call you blessed,",
      "verse": "24:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 163.271,
      "end": 165.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye shall be a delightsome land,",
      "verse": "24:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 165.959,
      "end": 167.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "24:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 168.404,
      "end": 170.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Your words have been stout against me,",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 170.813,
      "end": 172.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord.",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 172.293,
      "end": 173.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yet ye say:",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 173.866,
      "end": 175.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What have we spoken against thee?",
      "verse": "24:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 176.264,
      "end": 177.518,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye have said:",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 177.698,
      "end": 187.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "It is vain to serve God, and what doth it profit that we have kept his ordinances and that we have walked mournfully before the Lord of Hosts?",
      "verse": "24:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 187.991,
      "end": 190.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now we call the proud happy;",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 190.307,
      "end": 193.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they that work wickedness are set up;",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 193.181,
      "end": 195.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they that tempt God are even delivered.",
      "verse": "24:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 196.555,
      "end": 200.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then they that feared the Lord spake often one to another,",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 200.357,
      "end": 202.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord hearkened and heard;",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 202.952,
      "end": 208.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a book of remembrance was written before him for them that feared the Lord,",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 208.24,
      "end": 210.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that thought upon his name.",
      "verse": "24:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 210.87,
      "end": 215.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they shall be mine, saith the Lord of Hosts, in that day when I make up my jewels;",
      "verse": "24:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 215.694,
      "end": 220.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will spare them as a man spareth his own son that serveth him.",
      "verse": "24:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 220.925,
      "end": 222.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then shall ye return",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 222.638,
      "end": 225.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and discern between the righteous and the wicked,",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 225.558,
      "end": 227.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "between him that serveth God",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 227.828,
      "end": 229.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and him that serveth him not.",
      "verse": "24:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    }
  ]
}